      "Each inverter: 57 modules 440 Wp in 3 strings of 19 (25.1 kWp, Voc max ≈ 840 V at -10 °C); integrated DC switch and type 2 DC SPD",
      "Feeder to PV combiner: 4x95 mm² Cu XLPE, 65 m, ΔU ≈ 1.2 % at 145 A"
    ]
  },
